This repository is a throughline *source*: a requirements graph, not a program. It
re-expresses the OWASP Artificial Intelligence Security Verification Standard (AISVS) 1.0
as a grounded IDD graph so consuming projects can compose it with throughline-compose.

The AISVS clause text (each system_requirement's `text`), the per-category Control
Objectives (each intent's `text`) and the sub-section descriptions (each user_requirement's
`rationale`) are taken from:

  - OWASP AISVS — https://github.com/OWASP/AISVS
  - OWASP AISVS project page — https://owasp.org/www-project-artificial-intelligence-security-verification-standard/

